{% set title = '## **Requesting Keypad (DTMF) Input** procedure' %}

{% set body %}
Ask the user to enter their insurance number, phone number, or order ID (select the one needed based on the conversation) using the dial pad, then provide the following instruction: "When you are done, press the # (pound) key; to clear your input, press the * (star) key."

Wait for the user's input and proceed with the next step.
{% endset %}

{% set description %}
Use this procedure when the agent needs the User to type input (such as a phone number) using the dial pad. The agent asks the User for the required input and tells them how to submit it, which triggers the tool that disables the follow-up, switching the system into a waiting state for the User's keypad (DTMF) input instead of prompting the User again.
{% endset %}

